            "worktrees. Defaults fall back (with a stderr line) when a\n"
            "prerequisite is missing; explicit flags are refused instead.\n"
            "Lockstep mailboxes (no QUEUE.md) keep isolation off (serial)\n"
            "unless --isolate-workers is given."
        ),
        formatter_class=argparse.RawDescriptionHelpFormatter,
        epilog=(
            "environment variables:\n"
            "  TRIO_OMNIGENT_IDLE_DWELL  seconds a session must stay idle\n"
            "                            before a live role wait returns\n"
            "                            (default 30). interval=0 skips it.\n"
            "  TRIO_OMNIGENT_IDLE_DWELL_SLICE_EVAL  the same, for open-loop\n"
            "                            slice-evals only (default: the\n"
